data: {"id": "e5affd7dd0664a9a-thinking-parallel_evidence-1329", "run_id": "e5affd7dd0664a9a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 1. 实体身份与生命周期确认\n\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v`\n- **Pod UID**: `b134b5a8-7471-4feb-a975-9fbb0cc4f912`\n- **所在节点**: `node2`\n- **当前阶段**: 处于 `ContainerCreating`，尚未分配 Pod IP，容器未启动。\n- **可观测性现状**:\n  - **Metrics**: `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 `1`，等待原因为 `ContainerCreating`；未发生重启（`restarts=0`）。\n  - **Logging/Tracing**: 由于 Pod 未获得 IP 且未进入 Running 状态，无应用日志和流量记录，结果均为 `empty/absent`。这在 ContainerCreating 阶段是预期行为。\n\n# 2. Kubernetes 状态与事件调查 (kubectl_describe & kubectl_even", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788435814536, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

