data: {"id": "e5affd7dd0664a9a-thinking-parallel_evidence-2018", "run_id": "e5affd7dd0664a9a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突与缺口说明：\n\n### 1. 已确认的关键事实\n- **实体身份与状态**：Pod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` (UID: `b134b5a8-7471-4feb-a975-9fbb0cc4f912`) 调度在 `node2` 上，当前处于 `Pending` 阶段，状态为 `ContainerCreating`（未分配 IP）。\n- **根因事件**：`kubectl_events` 显示持续 60 分钟的 `Warning: NoNetworkFound`。Multus 因在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中找不到名为 `unavailable-network` 的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源，导致反复出现 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误。\n- **配置来源**：`kubectl_get_yaml` 确认该 Pod 的 Annotation `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks` 值为 `unavailable-network`，该引用是造成阻塞的", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788435842612, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "e5affd7dd0664a9a-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "e5affd7dd0664a9a", "seq": 2019, "ts_ms": 1788435848152, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 54.323, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/e5affd7dd0664a9a-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "567a12d32d261c4b1f59b0e4afb1b8fc201c07074a47617978e37694decb1d72", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "82a068bdf13e485c1dcce8faf186190e1087447ea03dd412b45bfb7f8545d5d4"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "e5affd7dd0664a9a-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "e5affd7dd0664a9a", "seq": 2020, "ts_ms": 1788435848153, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "e5affd7dd0664a9a-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "e5affd7dd0664a9a", "seq": 2021, "ts_ms": 1788435857950, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 9.796, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1886, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v 的 Multus CNI Annotation 引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network'，导致 Multus 无法创建 Pod Sandbox 并触发持续重试。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes (kubelet) | `fact-a5f6a5a1a773`: `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox ... Failed to create pod sandbox: ... plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed (add) ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05) ... not found` | 确证 Pod 无法创建沙箱的直接错误机制及关联组件 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes (multus) | `fact-5e921a58a14b` (最近): `Warning NoNetworkFound ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05) ... not found` | 持续触发 `unavailable-network` 查找失败的源事件模式 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `fact-13c83ca058c9`: `container \"app\"` 状态为 `ContainerCreating` (waiting) | 展示异常持续时间及容器停滞状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `fact-8063ef93bf09`: `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 `1`，标签 `reason=\"ContainerCreating\"` | 独立印证容器持续处于等待状态 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n事件 `fact-a5f6a5a1a773` 与 `fact-5e921a58a14b` 互为表里，明确了 `multus` CNI 插件因找不到 `network-attachment-definitions` 资源而调用失败，进而阻止 `kubelet` 创建 Pod 沙箱。Metric `fact-8063ef93bf09` 确认该状态已持续存在。日志与追踪数据因容器未启动而不适用（符合预期）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 的 Multus CNI Annotation 引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus 查找失败并报错 → kubelet 无法创建 Pod Sandbox → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态并持续重试\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\nPod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` 的 Multus CNI 配置错误地引用了名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络附件定义，但命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中不存在该资源（证据 1, 2）。这一缺失导致 Multus 插件初始化网络时失败，直接引发 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，使 Pod 陷入持续重试并卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（证据 3, 4）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v 的 Multus CNI Annotation 引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network'，导致 Multus 无法创建 Pod Sandbox 并触发持续重试。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes (kubelet) | `fact-a5f6a5a1a773`: `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox ... Failed to create pod sandbox: ... plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed (add) ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05) ... not found` | 确证 Pod 无法创建沙箱的直接错误机制及关联组件 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes (multus) | `fact-5e921a58a14b` (最近): `Warning NoNetworkFound ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05) ... not found` | 持续触发 `unavailable-network` 查找失败的源事件模式 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `fact-13c83ca058c9`: `container \"app\"` 状态为 `ContainerCreating` (waiting) | 展示异常持续时间及容器停滞状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `fact-8063ef93bf09`: `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 `1`，标签 `reason=\"ContainerCreating\"` | 独立印证容器持续处于等待状态 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n事件 `fact-a5f6a5a1a773` 与 `fact-5e921a58a14b` 互为表里，明确了 `multus` CNI 插件因找不到 `network-attachment-definitions` 资源而调用失败，进而阻止 `kubelet` 创建 Pod 沙箱。Metric `fact-8063ef93bf09` 确认该状态已持续存在。日志与追踪数据因容器未启动而不适用（符合预期）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 的 Multus CNI Annotation 引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus 查找失败并报错 → kubelet 无法创建 Pod Sandbox → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态并持续重试\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\nPod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` 的 Multus CNI 配置错误地引用了名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络附件定义，但命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中不存在该资源（证据 1, 2）。这一缺失导致 Multus 插件初始化网络时失败，直接引发 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，使 Pod 陷入持续重试并卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（证据 3, 4）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

